{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日劇天王木村拓哉日前一連兩場的台灣演唱會，已經圓滿落幕，吸引合共約1萬人捧場。前日，他離開台灣返回台灣前，突襲所屬事務所的在台灣官方週邊商店「巡舖」，在櫥窗簽名，又親民與店內的粉絲擊掌。</p><p>他此行在台灣又趁機大擦地道美食，大啖菜脯蛋、杏仁豆腐等。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:39:08.515126+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T14:03:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T16:50:51.216525+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T14:32:33.065798+00:00","content_hash":"620102d3d946b955bad10ea78854863ccbd7300b932dc19f5eab8cd29adea080","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T14:39:08.515126+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}